WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.763
Begin with the horizon.

00:00:01.763 --> 00:00:06.055
A low skyline leaves room for the sky to carry the mood.

00:00:06.055 --> 00:00:10.808
Next, separate warm lantern light from cool distant buildings.

00:00:10.808 --> 00:00:16.174
Give one small point of light more contrast than everything around it.

00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:22.307
Finally, hold the composition long enough for the viewer to discover that point.

00:00:22.307 --> 00:00:28.670
This is a visual planning exercise for Lumen Crossing, an original fictional world.

